{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Venomancer: Shadra's Presence and Shadra's Gift work natively (#1254, #1345)",
  "contract": "#1254, #1345: both are pure Spell.dbc modifiers that need no script. Shadra's Presence (504348) effect 0 is a party area aura 118 (MOD_HEALING_PCT) of bp 5, so +6 percent healing taken (value 5+1 with DieSides 1), and effect 1 is a SPELLMOD_EFFECT1 (aura 107, misc 3) of +1 on mask (0x4000,0,0), which selects Antivenom Dispel (803680) whose effect 0 cures 1 poison, so 2 with the passive. Shadra's Gift (706937 rank 1, 707868 rank 2) effect 2 is a SPELLMOD_CASTING_TIME percentage (aura 108, misc 10) of -10/-20 on mask (0,0x8000000,0x40000), which selects every Shadra's Prayer and Emerald Veil rank (base 2000 and 2500 ms); effect 1 is SPELL_AURA_REDUCE_PUSHBACK 35/70 read in Spell.cpp with no harness metric for a delayed cast, so only its amount is asserted. Each clause is measured against the same player before the passive.",
  "timeout_ms": 90000,
  "players": [
    {
      "id": "v",
      "race": 1,
      "class": 29,
      "level": 80
    },
    {
      "id": "ally",
      "race": 1,
      "class": 29,
      "level": 80
    }
  ],
  "location": {
